{"version":1,"content":"<p>法籍球星麥巴比（Kylian Mbappé）陷「辱華」爭議，昨晚向「所有被其言論傷害的人道歉」。</p><p>中國外交部發言人郭嘉昆28日主持例行記者會，對此作出回應：我們重視當事人作出的道歉。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:01:11.401493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:27:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:18:47.298337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:15.198773+00:00","content_hash":"836b42c35c4c2485dc0a2187660a43f6f423cda2626e405b8b9409f50d2622e3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}